WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.927
- We're sailing towards an iceberg,

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.972
this little white peak in the distance
getting closer and closer,

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:16.308
but really, it's been
underneath us the whole time.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:20.646
There's nothing worse than a kid.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.316
- We have some bad news on the case.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.069
The print we lifted
from the victim...

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.820
is from your son.

00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:30.113
- There's got to be
an explanation.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.075
They go to the same school,
Jacob's in his class.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.493
Yes, we know that.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.703
- Lynn, have you arrested my son?

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:40.832
- Before we begin,
I want to make something clear.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:44.294
A kid your age charged with
first degree murder...

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:46.338
is tried as an adult.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:49.174
- I swear I didn't do it.

00:00:49.258 --> 00:00:51.260
- We believe you.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.972
- You have admitted to
being in the park,

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.224
and a fellow student alleges
you had a knife

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:59.101
- you would bring to school.
- I guess so.

00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.895
- They're saying
he looked smug and remorseless.

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:04.147
This is gonna follow him around
for the rest of his life.

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:06.441
- It's a mistake.
We're gonna figure it out.

00:01:07.359 --> 00:01:08.944
- Do you have any doubts
about Jacob's innocence?

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:09.987
- No, of course not.

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.739
- Where is the knife now?

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.076
- So you've been lying to me.

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:17.202
- I did what any parent
would have done.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:20.205
Can't leave his fate
up to the courtroom.

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:25.043
My only job now is trying to
protect our son.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.714
- We're prisoners
in our own home,

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:30.841
- acting like we're normal.
- We are normal.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.342
Oh, my God,
you think this is normal?

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.803
- We gotta get
answers for ourselves.

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:36.013
I know what you did!

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.931
Lawyers have boundaries.

00:01:38.015 --> 00:01:39.975
I don't. Not anymore.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.644
 - Remember that in their eyes

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:45.731
it isn't just Jacob who's guilty.
You all are.

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:47.399
- Did you follow me here?

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.986
- This is damaging.
This is evidence.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:52.279
- You're scaring him.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:54.448
- Good! He should be scared.
I'm scared!

00:01:56.867 --> 00:02:00.037
- So I have to know.
I want the truth!

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:06.627
- You can be a good man,
or you can be a good father.

00:02:10.005 --> 00:02:12.633
- There was no normal
to go back to.

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.259
There was just before...

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.137
...and after.

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:19.348
[indistinct shouting]

